- logon-7166

- Tests multiple contracts belonging to the same SalesArea with the same Contract Header BillTo.

- The main point in this test is to trigger the comparison of SapBpEntity when adding 
  the contract header BillTo entities to the map. We want to ensure that our TreeSet
  comparator works (see DispokarteServiceBean.updateShiptoSalesAreas)

- All three contract requests have the same payer and bill to. Only the contract id
  is different. This, along with using an unused BP id (shipto and soldto) is enough
  to test the functionality. 
